{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o007c","title":"郑甘王照率众降封侯","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o007c-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"郑甘王照率众降封侯","evidence":["wendi-e-o007c-q"]},{"id":"wendi-a-p013-weishu","label":"裴注·魏书","text":"《魏书》补述郑甘王照及卢水胡来降，曹丕强调不动兵革受降。","evidence":["wendi-q-p013-weishu"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0006","role":"降封侯","evidence":["wendi-e-o007c-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0007","role":"降封侯","evidence":["wendi-e-o007c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年五月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o007c-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o007c-q","source_order":[2,41,"O007c"],"order":485},{"id":"wendi-e-o022b","title":"曹仁讨斩再叛的郑甘","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o022b-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"曹仁讨斩再叛的郑甘","evidence":["wendi-e-o022b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-ren","role":"讨斩","evidence":["wendi-e-o022b-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0006","role":"反叛被斩","evidence":["wendi-e-o022b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"黄初二年五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o019","basis":"黄初二年五月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o022b-q","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o022b-q","source_order":[2,231,"O022b"],"order":578},{"id":"mantian-e-o034b","title":"淮行征羌护军护郃秋讨郑甘卢水皆平","accounts":[{"id":"mantian-a-bd73ed0e00f760308834","label":"正文","text":"淮行征羌护军护郃秋讨郑甘卢水皆平","evidence":["mantian-q-d6957423fd8f4bb7bf87"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0100","role":"行征羌护军、护郃秋讨山贼郑甘卢水叛胡皆破平","evidence":["mantian-q-d6957423fd8f4bb7bf87"]},{"person":"wudi-p0183","role":"被护之左将军","evidence":["mantian-q-d6957423fd8f4bb7bf87"]},{"person":"wudi-p0283","role":"被护之冠军将军","evidence":["mantian-q-d6957423fd8f4bb7bf87"]},{"person":"wendi-p0006","role":"山贼被讨平","evidence":["mantian-q-d6957423fd8f4bb7bf87"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["mantian-q-d6957423fd8f4bb7bf87"]},"ordering_evidence":"mantian-q-d6957423fd8f4bb7bf87","source_order":[26,284,22],"order":5252}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0006","name":"郑甘","evidence":["wendi-q-o007","mantian-q-d6957423fd8f4bb7bf87"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wendi-m-o007-wendi-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o007"]},{"id":"wendi-m-o022-wendi-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o022"]},{"id":"wendi-m-p013-wendi-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-p013"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mantian-q-d6957423fd8f4bb7bf87","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-6e6989442ca7108d4603","layer":"original","quote":"又行征羌护军〖8〗，护左将军张郃、冠军将军杨秋，讨山贼郑甘、卢水叛胡〖9〗，皆破平之；关中始定，民得安业","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":283,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":22,"end":74},{"id":"wendi-e-o007c-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-aff500edc4a38bf656c0","layer":"original","quote":"是月，冯翊山贼郑甘、王照率众降〖8〗，皆封列侯。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":56,"end":80},{"id":"wendi-e-o022b-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f05723e78a83ba5b015e","layer":"original","quote":"五月，郑甘复叛，遣曹仁讨斩之。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":31},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wendi-q-o007","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-aff500edc4a38bf656c0","layer":"original","quote":"五月戊寅〖4〗，天子命王追尊皇祖太尉曰“太王”〖5〗，夫人丁氏曰“太王后”〖6〗；封王子叡为武德侯〖7〗。﹝三﹞是月，冯翊山贼郑甘、王照率众降〖8〗，皆封列侯。﹝四﹞酒泉黄华、张掖张进等各执太守以叛〖9〗。金城太守苏则讨进，斩之〖10〗。华降。﹝五﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183},{"id":"wendi-q-o022","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f05723e78a83ba5b015e","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，以车骑将军曹仁为大将军。五月，郑甘复叛，遣曹仁讨斩之。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31},{"id":"wendi-q-p013","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-be23dc1148fe349c2990","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《魏书》曰：“初，郑甘、王照及卢水胡率其属来降。王得降书以示朝曰：‘前欲有令吾讨鲜卑者，吾不从而降；又有欲使吾及今秋讨卢水胡者，吾不听，今又降。昔魏武侯一谋而当，有自得之色，见讥李悝。吾今说此，非自是也；徒以为坐而降之，其功大于动兵革也。’”","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8df4b464251e54dc3337","start":0,"end":124},{"id":"wendi-q-p013-weishu","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-be23dc1148fe349c2990","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《魏书》曰：“初，郑甘、王照及卢水胡率其属来降。王得降书以示朝曰：‘前欲有令吾讨鲜卑者，吾不从而降；又有欲使吾及今秋讨卢水胡者，吾不听，今又降。昔魏武侯一谋而当，有自得之色，见讥李悝。吾今说此，非自是也；徒以为坐而降之，其功大于动兵革也。’”","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8df4b464251e54dc3337","start":0,"end":124}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
